{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a first-person horror inspired by real-life haunted tunnels. You'll explore a sealed tunnel filled with fear and tension. Can you make it out alive and find your way back home?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through a sealed tunnel rumored to harbor something sinister, and uncover the truth that lies beyond the terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short first-person walking simulator that offers a similar feeling to actually testing your courage in a haunted location.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are multiple endings to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 - 30 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming and Video Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no restrictions on streaming or creating video content for this game. Feel free to enjoy and share!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can adjust various settings from the options menu, including graphics and mouse sensitivity:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWindowed Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbQuality Settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbMouse Sensitivity</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbFlashlight Brightness</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbVolume Adjustments</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u9e7f\u3067\u3057\u305f","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812080/36dfcea600f9ca2253abac5abab874c75b4cf123.jpg"},{"name":"End1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812080/15a7985c1f01a3e809d0c12d3b25d5a19230dfa5.jpg"},{"name":"End2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812080/87db76c22ed2f89f21303af04e9c56e51f389ae3.jpg"},{"name":"End3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3812080/513ea58c714e14c5f5bb6e5929ad6